flowchart TB
    accTitle: Network shutdown uses one grace period
    accDescr: Shutdown closes admissions and bootstrap state, allows all owned network tasks a single total three-second grace, then aborts remaining tasks and clears peers.
    Stop["Serialize shutdown and close task registry"]
    Signal["Signal stop and close admission slots<br/>Clear bootstrap advertisement and cache"]
    Grace["Join owned network tasks<br/>One total 3 s grace period"]
    Abort["Abort and join remaining tasks<br/>After shared deadline"]
    Clear["Clear peers and release resources<br/>Writers and remaining connection permits"]
    Stop --> Signal
    Signal --> Grace
    Grace -->|"If tasks remain"| Abort
    Abort --> Clear
    Grace -->|"All tasks finished"| Clear
